<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fa">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Channels Mini App</title>

    <script src="https://telegram.org/js/telegram-web-app.js"></script>

    <style>
        body {
            font-family: sans-serif;
            text-align: center;
            direction: rtl;
            padding: 25px;
            background: #f2f2f2;
        }
        .channel {
            background: white;
            padding: 15px;
            margin: 15px 0;
            border-radius: 10px;
            font-size: 20px;
            cursor: pointer;
            box-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);
            transition: 0.2s;
        }
        .channel:active {
            transform: scale(0.97);
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <h2>کانال‌های من 🔰</h2>
    <p>روی هر کانال بزنی، وارد همون چنل میشی.</p>

    <!-- کانال اول -->
    <div class="channel" onclick="openChannel('@shadow_alonex')">
        Shadow Alonex
    </div>

    <!-- کانال دوم -->
    <div class="channel" onclick="openChannel('@NiCaToR_NKR')">
        NiCaToR NKR
    </div>

    <!-- کانال سوم -->
    <div class="channel" onclick="openChannel('@XO_OSKAR')">
        XO OSKAR
    </div>

    <script>
        function openChannel(url) {
            window.location.href = url;
        }
    </script>

</body>
</html>
